### Call the workflow_status_set tool for a pull request; expects its itemUrl and the canonical status "Development"
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 21,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "workflow_status_set",
    "arguments": {
      "repo": "credfeto/credfeto-workflow-mcp",
      "pr": 82,
      "status": "Development"
    }
  }
}

### Call the workflow_status_set tool for an issue with a lower-case status; expects its itemUrl and the canonical status "AI Review"
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 22,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "workflow_status_set",
    "arguments": {
      "repo": "credfeto/credfeto-workflow-mcp",
      "issue": 12,
      "status": "ai review"
    }
  }
}

### Call the workflow_status_set tool with both pr and issue; expects a tool error naming the "pr" parameter
