  "params": {
    "name": "workflow_status_set",
    "arguments": {
      "repo": "credfeto/credfeto-workflow-mcp",
      "pr": 82,
      "issue": 12,
      "status": "Development"
    }
  }
}

### Call the workflow_status_set tool with an unknown status; expects a tool error listing the valid workflow states
